module mistake_rowname .
rem expect: E-TYPE-ROWNAME

rem ko: ✘ 슬라이스에는 다른 이름을 붙이지 못한다 --- `slice u8` 를 그대로 적는다 /// en: ✘ a slice is not given another name --- write `slice u8` as it is
def type bytes slice u8 .

fn first input b bytes . output u8 .
  requires gt len b. . 0 . .
do
  return idx b. 0 . .
end .
